<title>USA: Computer Sciences Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Computer Sciences Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>EL SEGUNDO, Calif., Jan 22 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.73		    $0.25</p>
<p> Net		 57,390		   19,721</p>
<p> Revs		1,421,638		1,236,674</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  78,494		   77,708</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.49		    $1.24</p>
<p> Net		 116,673		  95,231</p>
<p> Revs		4,080,785		3,448,285</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  78,114		   76,819</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) The non-recurring charge of $48.9 million for the nine months ended Dec. 27, 1996, relates to the Aug. 1, 1996, acquisition of The Continuum Company, Inc. The charge, net of income taxes, is $35.3 million or $0.45 per share. During the quarter and nine months ended Dec. 29, 1995, $26 million of purchased research and development was expensed in connection with the acquisition by Continuum of SOCS Holding. The charge, which carried no tax deduction, is $0.34 per share.</p>
